{"last_link_id": 406, "extensions": {"seed_widgets": {"58": 0}}, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["# ComfyUI：MOSS-Image Edit 官方工作流\n\n## 本期资源\n- [模型工作流下载](https://pan.quark.cn/s/14bb20d001ed)，[在线工作流](https://www.runninghub.cn/post/2108928021003595778/?inviteCode=f7ykr23y)\n\n- 官方模型仓库：[Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image)\n\n- [moss_image_edit_lora](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/loras/moss_image_edit_lora_rank_64_bf16.safetensors) (rank 64, bf16, 297 MB)\n\n## 模型存放路径\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   ├── 📂 diffusion_models/\n│   │   ├── moss_image_sft_int8_convrot.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 loras/\n│   │   └── moss_image_edit_lora_rank_64_bf16.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 text_encoders/\n│   │   └── qwen3.5_9b_w4a8_gptq.safetensors\n│   └── 📂 vae/\n│        └── flux2-vae_small.safetensors\n```\n## Prompt upsampler\n\nThe `enable_prompt_upsampler` switch on the **Text to Image (MOSS-Image)** node is **true**, so a short prompt is rewritten into one full\nscene caption before it reaches the model. The upsampler runs on MOSS-Image's own text encoder\n(`qwen3.5_9b_w4a8_gptq.safetensors`, loaded with `type = moss_image`), the same file the model already needs — no second\ntext encoder to download. Set the switch to `false` to send the raw prompt; either way the caption actually used is shown in the\n`PreviewAny` node inside the subgraph.\n\n\n## Prompt skill\n\nThe system prompt driving the upsampler is written from the official [MOSS-Image Prompt Enhancer skill](https://github.com/OpenMOSS/MOSS-Image/blob/main/skills/moss-image-prompt-enhancer/SKILL.md). The same skill turns an idea into a caption or a Layout prompt outside ComfyUI, and it is the reference for the caption style this model was trained on."], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [524.1877926429131, 523.597749573305], "pos": [-1082.9795753788335, -1130.7276805571678], "id": 44, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0, "widgets_values_named": {"text": "# ComfyUI：MOSS-Image Edit 官方工作流\n\n## 本期资源\n- [模型工作流下载](https://pan.quark.cn/s/14bb20d001ed)，[在线工作流](https://www.runninghub.cn/post/2108928021003595778/?inviteCode=f7ykr23y)\n\n- 官方模型仓库：[Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image)\n\n- [moss_image_edit_lora](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MOSS-Image/resolve/main/loras/moss_image_edit_lora_rank_64_bf16.safetensors) (rank 64, bf16, 297 MB)\n\n## 模型存放路径\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   ├── 📂 diffusion_models/\n│   │   ├── moss_image_sft_int8_convrot.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 loras/\n│   │   └── moss_image_edit_lora_rank_64_bf16.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 text_encoders/\n│   │   └── qwen3.5_9b_w4a8_gptq.safetensors\n│   └── 📂 vae/\n│        └── flux2-vae_small.safetensors\n```\n## Prompt upsampler\n\nThe `enable_prompt_upsampler` switch on the **Text to Image (MOSS-Image)** node is **true**, so a short prompt is rewritten into one full\nscene caption before it reaches the model. The upsampler runs on MOSS-Image's own text encoder\n(`qwen3.5_9b_w4a8_gptq.safetensors`, loaded with `type = moss_image`), the same file the model already needs — no second\ntext encoder to download. Set the switch to `false` to send the raw prompt; either way the caption actually used is shown in the\n`PreviewAny` node inside the subgraph.\n\n\n## Prompt skill\n\nThe system prompt driving the upsampler is written from the official [MOSS-Image Prompt Enhancer skill](https://github.com/OpenMOSS/MOSS-Image/blob/main/skills/moss-image-prompt-enhancer/SKILL.md). The same skill turns an idea into a caption or a Layout prompt outside ComfyUI, and it is the reference for the caption style this model was trained on."}}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["## MOSS-Image 的能力与限制\n\n来源：[USERGUIDE](https://github.com/OpenMOSS/MOSS-Image/blob/main/USERGUIDE.md)、README、HF Base/SFT 模型卡；并与社区基准测试笔记交叉核对。\n\n### 分辨率\n\n| 项目 | 官方说明 |\n|------|----------|\n| 推荐总像素 | **1M、1.5M 或 2M** |\n| 外推范围 | **0.25M（512×512）至 4M（约 2K）** |\n| 宽高比 | 任意；宽高必须为 **16** 的正整数倍 |\n| 本模板默认 | 1024×1024（约 1M） |\n\n### 优势\n\n- 约 **5B** 单流 DiT（Muon）；FLUX.2 小型 VAE；Qwen 系列文本编码器。\n- 强中英双语文字渲染与自动布局；支持针对文字/物体的 JSON 布局控制；长提示词（约 **4K** tokens）；动漫与写实风格。\n- **SFT** 文本分组与布局更清晰；**Base** 未做后训练/CFG 蒸馏（更适合社区 LoRA）。\n- 输入形式：自然语言、标签序列、JSON 布局（布局功能为实验性）。建议优先使用英文（训练数据以英文为主）；支持中文。\n\n### 限制 / 注意事项\n\n- 自动换行可能不符合意图——需要精确文字时请使用 `\\n` 或真实换行。\n- 关闭 SLG 看起来更写实，但可能导致细节坍缩；官方负分支跳层为第 **22** 层（24/26 也有帮助）。kijai 指出 SLG 可能让动漫风格过曝。\n- 推荐负向提示词：`nsfw, worst quality, bad anatomy, watermark, jpeg artifact`\n- 显存紧张时，降低分辨率或使用 Sequential / CPU offload。\n- 自行训练 LoRA 时，**冻结文本编码器**。\n- 许可：Apache 2.0。\n\n---\n\n## 采样设置与官方默认值对比\n\n| 设置 | 本模板 | OpenMOSS 官方 |\n|---------|---------------|-------------------|\n| 步数 | 25 | 50 |\n| CFG | 2.5 | 3 |\n| 采样器 | er_sde | Euler |\n| 调度器 | simple | 默认 |\n| 降噪 | 1 | 1 |\n| Shift | 5（模型默认） | 5（相同） |\n\n本模板采用 kijai 的 ComfyUI MOSS-Image PR [#17095](https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI/pull/17095) 中的快速设置。这是速度上的取舍，不是 bug。若想更接近官方效果，可尝试 50 步、CFG 3。\n\n### 社区笔记\n\n- **跳层引导（Skip layer guidance）：** 可能让动漫风格过曝；未建议替代取值（模板保留官方第 22 层）。可在子图内查看细节设置。\n- **Shift：** 用 ModelSamplingAuraFlow 或 ModelSamplingFlux 调整——ModelSamplingSD3 使用的是完全不同的尺度。可进入子图调整。\n- **SFT 色带：** 实验性 LoRA，强度约 −0.5：[moss_image_sft_lora_blocks_21_to_49…](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/MOSS-image_experimental/blob/main/loras/moss_image_sft_lora_blocks_21_to_49_rank_512_bf16.safetensors)"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [524.1877926429131, 928.6326913090904], "pos": [-2255.3551606646597, -1130.7276805571678], "id": 45, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 1, "widgets_values_named": {"text": "## MOSS-Image 的能力与限制\n\n来源：[USERGUIDE](https://github.com/OpenMOSS/MOSS-Image/blob/main/USERGUIDE.md)、README、HF Base/SFT 模型卡；并与社区基准测试笔记交叉核对。\n\n### 分辨率\n\n| 项目 | 官方说明 |\n|------|----------|\n| 推荐总像素 | **1M、1.5M 或 2M** |\n| 外推范围 | **0.25M（512×512）至 4M（约 2K）** |\n| 宽高比 | 任意；宽高必须为 **16** 的正整数倍 |\n| 本模板默认 | 1024×1024（约 1M） |\n\n### 优势\n\n- 约 **5B** 单流 DiT（Muon）；FLUX.2 小型 VAE；Qwen 系列文本编码器。\n- 强中英双语文字渲染与自动布局；支持针对文字/物体的 JSON 布局控制；长提示词（约 **4K** tokens）；动漫与写实风格。\n- **SFT** 文本分组与布局更清晰；**Base** 未做后训练/CFG 蒸馏（更适合社区 LoRA）。\n- 输入形式：自然语言、标签序列、JSON 布局（布局功能为实验性）。建议优先使用英文（训练数据以英文为主）；支持中文。\n\n### 限制 / 注意事项\n\n- 自动换行可能不符合意图——需要精确文字时请使用 `\\n` 或真实换行。\n- 关闭 SLG 看起来更写实，但可能导致细节坍缩；官方负分支跳层为第 **22** 层（24/26 也有帮助）。kijai 指出 SLG 可能让动漫风格过曝。\n- 推荐负向提示词：`nsfw, worst quality, bad anatomy, watermark, jpeg artifact`\n- 显存紧张时，降低分辨率或使用 Sequential / CPU offload。\n- 自行训练 LoRA 时，**冻结文本编码器**。\n- 许可：Apache 2.0。\n\n---\n\n## 采样设置与官方默认值对比\n\n| 设置 | 本模板 | OpenMOSS 官方 |\n|---------|---------------|-------------------|\n| 步数 | 25 | 50 |\n| CFG | 2.5 | 3 |\n| 采样器 | er_sde | Euler |\n| 调度器 | simple | 默认 |\n| 降噪 | 1 | 1 |\n| Shift | 5（模型默认） | 5（相同） |\n\n本模板采用 kijai 的 ComfyUI MOSS-Image PR [#17095](https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI/pull/17095) 中的快速设置。这是速度上的取舍，不是 bug。若想更接近官方效果，可尝试 50 步、CFG 3。\n\n### 社区笔记\n\n- **跳层引导（Skip layer guidance）：** 可能让动漫风格过曝；未建议替代取值（模板保留官方第 22 层）。可在子图内查看细节设置。\n- **Shift：** 用 ModelSamplingAuraFlow 或 ModelSamplingFlux 调整——ModelSamplingSD3 使用的是完全不同的尺度。可进入子图调整。\n- **SFT 色带：** 实验性 LoRA，强度约 −0.5：[moss_image_sft_lora_blocks_21_to_49…](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/MOSS-image_experimental/blob/main/loras/moss_image_sft_lora_blocks_21_to_49_rank_512_bf16.safetensors)"}}, {"showAdvanced": true, "outputs": [{"name": "CLIP", "links": [396, 397], "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "CLIP"}], "widgets_values": ["qwen3.5_9b_w4a8_gptq.safetensors", "moss_image", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "clip_name"}, "name": "clip_name", "label": "clip_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "clip_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "type"}, "name": "type", "label": "type", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "type"}, {"widget": {"name": "device"}, "shape": 7, "name": "device", "label": "device", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "device"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPLoader", "mode": 0, "size": [270, 106], "pos": [285.3283783146086, -897.6507569080717], "id": 50, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.42.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPLoader"}, "order": 2, "widgets_values_named": {"clip_name": "qwen3.5_9b_w4a8_gptq.safetensors", "type": "moss_image", "device": "default"}}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [100], "label": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "LATENT"}], "size": [299.57325178632186, 642.6771477619825], "pos": [1163.2082172640796, -1130.7276805571678], "widgets_values": [808084987423628, "fixed", 40, 4, "euler", "simple", 1], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 153, "label": "model", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}, {"name": "positive", "link": 208, "label": "positive", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "positive"}, {"name": "negative", "link": 209, "label": "negative", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "negative"}, {"name": "latent_image", "link": 205, "label": "latent_image", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "latent_image"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "steps"}, "name": "steps", "label": "steps", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "steps"}, {"widget": {"name": "cfg"}, "name": "cfg", "label": "cfg", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "cfg"}, {"widget": {"name": "sampler_name"}, "name": "sampler_name", "label": "sampler_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "sampler_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "scheduler"}, "name": "scheduler", "label": "scheduler", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "scheduler"}, {"widget": {"name": "denoise"}, "name": "denoise", "label": "denoise", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "denoise"}], "flags": {}, "id": 58, "type": "KSampler", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.42.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "KSampler"}, "order": 17, "widgets_values_named": {"scheduler": "simple", "denoise": 1, "seed": 808084987423628, "cfg": 4, "sampler_name": "euler", "steps": 40, "control_after_generate": "fixed"}}, {"showAdvanced": true, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [153], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["", "22", 0, 1], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 197, "label": "model", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "double_layers"}, "name": "double_layers", "label": "double_layers", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "double_layers"}, {"widget": {"name": "single_layers"}, "name": "single_layers", "label": "single_layers", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "single_layers"}, {"widget": {"name": "start_percent"}, "name": "start_percent", "label": "start_percent", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "start_percent"}, {"widget": {"name": "end_percent"}, "name": "end_percent", "label": "end_percent", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "end_percent"}], "flags": {}, "type": "SkipLayerGuidanceDiTSimple", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [270, 130], "pos": [831.2082172640796, -1130.7276805571678], "id": 60, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.42.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SkipLayerGuidanceDiTSimple"}, "order": 16, "widgets_values_named": {"single_layers": "22", "double_layers": "", "start_percent": 0, "end_percent": 1}}, {"showAdvanced": true, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [231], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["moss_image_sft_int8_convrot.safetensors", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "unet_name"}, "name": "unet_name", "label": "unet_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "unet_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "weight_dtype"}, "name": "weight_dtype", "label": "weight_dtype", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "weight_dtype"}], "flags": {}, "type": "UNETLoader", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [270, 82], "pos": [-496.7917827359204, -1130.7276805571678], "id": 61, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.42.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "UNETLoader"}, "order": 3, "widgets_values_named": {"weight_dtype": "default", "unet_name": "moss_image_sft_int8_convrot.safetensors"}}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [405], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}], "size": [140, 46], "pos": [1524.7814690504015, -1130.7276805571678], "inputs": [{"name": "samples", "link": 100, "label": "samples", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "samples"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 395, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}], "flags": {}, "id": 63, "type": "VAEDecode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.42.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAEDecode"}, "order": 18}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "VAE", "links": [394, 395], "label": "VAE", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "VAE"}], "size": [270, 58], "pos": [285.3283783146086, -693.6507569080717], "widgets_values": ["flux2-vae.safetensors"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "vae_name"}, "name": "vae_name", "label": "vae_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "vae_name"}], "flags": {}, "id": 65, "type": "VAELoader", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.42.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAELoader"}, "order": 4, "widgets_values_named": {"vae_name": "flux2-vae.safetensors"}}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["## MOSS-Image：图像编辑\n用简短指令修改一张图片。编辑LoRA基于MOSS-Image SFT检查点运行，指令与原图一起编码作为参考，采样器会重绘相同画面，仅应用指令描述的改动。\n\n### 使用方法\n1. **加载图像**：待编辑的图片。图片会被缩放到100万像素，并对齐至16像素；**获取图像尺寸**将该尺寸传入**Flux2空潜像**，保证输出图和原图宽高比一致。\n2. **MOSS-Image编辑正向文本编码**：仅描述需要做出的改动。采用该LoRA训练时的句式效果最佳：`仅将X修改为Y。保持人物、面部、头发、姿势、背景和构图不变。`\n3. **MOSS-Image编辑反向文本编码**：模型推荐的反向提示词。该分支同样读取参考图，用于描述需要规避的效果，而非描述要从画面中移除的内容。\n4. **K采样器**：30步，CFG 4.0，`euler`，`normal`，去噪强度1：为LoRA作者给出的默认参数。\n5. 加入队列运行。**保存图像**输出 `image_moss_image_edit_*.png`；**图像对比**并排展示原图与生成结果。\n\n### edit_format 必须和LoRA匹配\n`edit_format` 用于选择该LoRA训练时采用的数据格式。两个编码节点必须填写相同的值。\n\n| 值 | 训练所用格式 |\n|-------|--------------|\n| `Moss-Image-Edit` | `moss_image_edit_lora_rank_64_bf16.safetensors`，本工作流加载的LoRA |\n| `ai-toolkit` | ai-toolkit 的 MOSS-Image 编辑训练格式 |\n| `ai-toolkit (kv_cache off)` | 关闭`kv_cache`的同格式：参考图会对当前生成图像做注意力计算，每一步都重新计算参考特征 |\n\n选错格式依然可以出图，但效果变差：主体样貌、取景构图、细节会和原图出现明显偏移。\n\n### 分辨率\n参考图会以输入时的原始尺寸送入扩散模型。原图经过**图像按总像素缩放**（100万像素，16像素对齐）一次性缩放，参考图和生成画面都使用这个尺寸。\n降低至约26万像素（长边512像素）可以减少算力消耗，但约束变弱：模型会重新调整主体构图，而不是在给定画面内做局部编辑。\n\n### 采样相关\n- **跳跃层引导**保持开启，单层`22`，调度权重区间0至1.0：LoRA作者给出的默认配置。\n- CFG设为4.0代表反向分支作用明显。如果你修改上衣时画面凭空多出项链、耳饰，说明该LoRA下CFG过低，请维持4.0不变。\n\n### 多参考图用法\n编码节点支持自动扩展 `images.image_0`、`images.image_1`……最多接入四张参考图（服装、面部、道具等），并在提示词里说明每张图的用途。只有接入图片时才会多出对应通道；空着不接不会产生额外开销。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [524.1877926429131, 928.6326913090904], "pos": [-1669.1673680217466, -1130.7276805571678], "id": 113, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 5, "widgets_valu